==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|wige||cradle}}, from {{inh|de|goh|wīga}}, {{m|goh|wiega}}, referring to movement and therefore likely related to {{der|de|gmw-pro|*waggjan|t=to cause to move}}.

